Subject: [meta-python2][gatesgarth][PATCH 1/3] python2-target-recipes-blacklist.inc: add and .inc file with conditional blacklist of target python2 recipes
Date: Wed, 24 Mar 2021 17:50:08 +0100
Message-Id: <20210324165010.391197-1-Martin.Jansa@gmail.com>
